@title Heat: the cabinet follows the chosen enclosure (large synthetic enclosure)
@area Heat
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Fixture qa/fixtures/cabinet-heat-spec-large.novo (make_heat_spec_fixtures.py): the example cabinet with an `encl.` record, synthetic catalogue enclosure 1400x1800x500 mm. Compare with 9500 (1000x1400x300): same devices and plate, only the record differs, so the heat result must differ. The heat message lines name the enclosure and say it is an estimate.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-heat-spec-large.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate heat of the cabinet
wait 4
key Enter
wait_s 60
expect "SYNTH.LARGE"
shot 01-large-spec
check_blank 01-large-spec
check_layout
